-body drawing. \nFor the Actual footage, you can draw whatever you want.\n\nI wish you can write a signature for me🥺🤲🏻 \nYou need to write: \n 1. Happy Birthday/HBD\n  2. To Soyau \nplease send me a difference image with and without a signature.  \n\nI was very satisfied with the last commission, so you can keep the style of drawing the character the same.💕  \n\nI would like to have a jpeg&psd file.   \n\n-OTHER- \nI might put the work on SNS.\n\nSoyau\n\n  依頼経験が少なく、何か失礼がありましたら申し訳ございません。  \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dYUsFa5NpHINu2s3ZMPuPHyIVQzENMdf", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@c_c000100uR/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3722099, "client_id": 3319378, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/59dce8b4/uploads/origins/1aab152d-ed5a-441c-84d8-9f9e60db6f45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5282d331111e0f8e9b8e1154fa861ed9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/59dce8b4/uploads/origins/1aab152d-ed5a-441c-84d8-9f9e60db6f45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5282d331111e0f8e9b8e1154fa861ed9, https://si.imgix.net/59dce8b4/uploads/origins/1aab152d-ed5a-441c-84d8-9f9e60db6f45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1afa3a7bf3373f3500105c7171e6cbf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/59dce8b4/uploads/origins/1aab152d-ed5a-441c-84d8-9f9e60db6f45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d6e256fea8be2155a62fe8d2b740285 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/59dce8b4/uploads/origins/1aab152d-ed5a-441c-84d8-9f9e60db6f45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e803a501224492b641512f5fc3dbda00", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5